{
  "_comment": "Copy to rtg-dev-world.json and fill in a world seeded in your local MySQL. Create one with: curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/worlds -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"name\":\"Douglas Survey\",\"spawnLat\":42.7597,\"spawnLng\":-105.3822}'. Then 'Routes to Glory > 6b. Connect Echo Sites to Live API' reads this file. For iPhone builds on the same Wi‑Fi as your Mac, set apiBaseUrl to your Mac's LAN IP (e.g. http://192.168.1.42:3001/api) — localhost only works in the Unity Editor.",
  "apiBaseUrl": "http://localhost:3001/api",
  "worldId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "empireId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "accessCode": "XXXXXX",
  "slug": "your-world-slug"
}
